{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_02",
  "title": "祈祷",
  "storyCode": "MT-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0345af973900eba1b95a90d7e6b62bb21c80c43487a67a79b1f549adebb84b6d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "法柏尔区，博尔戈街，铳械工坊"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "......你好，有人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这间工坊不大，充当货架的圣徒像随意陈列，它们以各种匪夷所思的姿势向客人展示着铳械......\n但阿摩斯并未看到一个客人，他一路走来，除了自己，并没有什么人在工坊的门前停留。“冷清”——这是阿摩斯的第一感受。\n也不至于连老板都不见踪影吧，他看着昏暗的灯光打在那些圣徒像上，心想。“诡异”——这是阿摩斯的第二感受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "潘格尼尼先生在吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "（说真的，为什么铳械工坊的老板要叫这样滑稽的名字......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿摩斯四处打量，突然撞到了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他猛然回头，对上了一双硕大而透亮的眼睛，那眼睛隐在阴影里，直勾勾地盯着他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大眼睛",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "救......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大眼睛",
      "text": "*拉特兰俚语*你谁啊乱闯我的地盘——等我戴个眼镜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大眼睛",
      "text": "公务员？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大眼睛",
      "text": "对不住啊，最近也没生意，躲在里面睡觉，没想到会有公务员先生大驾光临。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "枢机辅佐官阿摩斯，来确认这间铳械工坊的接收事宜。您就是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "我就是名字很滑稽的潘格尼尼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "等等，黎博利？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "难不成我看起来像萨科塔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "啊抱歉，我的意思是，我没见过黎博利从事这个职业。毕竟，守护铳只有萨科塔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "有什么问题？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "很多厨子都不吃自己做的菜，我只是没法使用自己造的武器罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "你要检查我的铳械制造资质证明吗？放眼整个拉特兰，出自我手的守护铳没有一千也有八百，说不定你手上的这把......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "啧啧，一看做工就很“顶级”，我倒是没这样的手艺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "不过如今都没什么所谓了，反正这里就要关停了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "近期所有的订单都已经退掉了，店里新完工的这一批铳，到时候让公证所的人直接带走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "原、原来您已经做好了准备。我本以为......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "会很麻烦？我这个人会很难搞？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "我、我不是这个意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "注册资料显示，这间铳械工坊已有百年历史。身为黎博利，您却选择为萨科塔造守护铳，这里对您来说一定意义非凡——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "行了行了。这几年来谁都知道铳械工坊要成为历史了，大家都只是在等那个时候到来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "你问我愿不愿意，我当然不愿意。需要我把最近这段时间彻夜难眠的煎熬过程倾诉给你听吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "如果您需要倾诉，我可以帮您拦一辆告解车，告解费由七厅承担。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "那恐怕还是你更需要告解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "我已经是个要退休的老头了，但梵里妮，我的学徒，她甚至还没来得及亲手为自己做一把守护铳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "既然铳械工坊将不复存在，你们得负责那孩子后续的发展。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "当然，铳械工坊的关停，只是为了让铳械生产的流程变得更正规、更高效。像您与您的学徒这样的铳械工匠，仍是宝贵的人才。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "我会向负责民政的第六厅汇报。您的学徒——梵里妮小姐，应当会被推荐到米迦莱昂区即将落成的制铳圣堂工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "“制铳圣堂”......啧。但愿他们开工制铳的那天，还能像起这个名字的时候那么自信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "我当然相信拉特兰的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "行了行了，这种鬼话我听得够多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "......那么，如果没有别的问题，请您在关停文件上签字吧，潘格尼尼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "即时起，此铳械工坊的所有业务都将终止，后续会由中庭公证所跟进具体的接收事宜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "那么，再见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "不送。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "法柏尔区，博尔戈街......真是熟悉啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "哈，就是这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鲁珀",
      "text": "终于完成接驳了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库兰塔",
      "text": "应、应该吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库兰塔",
      "text": "在外围等了两天，我想赶紧出去透口气！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲林",
      "text": "真是的，是这帮拉特兰人在我们流浪的时候邀请我们登上了这座移动修道院，结果到了拉特兰又让我们干等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "让各位久等了，非常抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "在此之前，已经有十二座移动修道院陆续抵达了拉特兰，加上万国峰会期间事务繁多，希望各位理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "公证所已在安布罗修区准备了短期的安置住宅，等到各位安顿下来，第六厅将协助各位办理户籍和社会福利事宜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鲁珀",
      "text": "等、等等，修女，没理解错的话，我们这些外族人以后可以在拉特兰常住？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "以第二届万国峰会为契机，拉特兰将向所有种族敞开怀抱......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "这里也将成为“你们的城市”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂喂，添头，你还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我让他们去找医生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？",
      "text": "别去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？",
      "text": "暂时别让那帮萨科塔发现......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "请让我过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库兰塔",
      "text": "修女，不用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲林",
      "text": "我们能处理，你刚刚不是说还有很多事情要忙吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "嘶——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "萨卡兹......你怀孕了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "你们的人邀请大家伙进修道院的时候可没拦着萨卡兹，怎么，现在又想拿出来说事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "我可以马上走，我不稀罕萨科塔的帮助！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "所以你们也别想对付我和我的孩子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "各位误会了，只是修道院的常规对接事务中并不包含如何安置一位怀孕的母亲，安吉修女一下子没有反应过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "安吉修女，请允许我将她带回育婴圣堂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "阁下，育婴圣堂还未正式对外开放，这不符合规定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "以及，您怎么在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "主遣我至应至之地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "规定只是死物。育婴圣堂不可能无视一位病重的母亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "女士，我叫歧法，拉特兰育婴圣堂的牧首，唔，也就是负责人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "金发女性缓缓转向萨卡兹，她的声音很轻柔，但是又足够清晰，像是在小心翼翼地试探着什么。\n萨卡兹的视线划过她头顶那两对漆黑的尖角，落在她的眼睛上。透过眼罩繁复的雕纹，她看到了一片虚无。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "你是什么......萨卡兹，还是萨科塔？而且还是个瞎子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "萨卡兹、萨科塔，这些词语本不必被用于强调区别。我与你何其相似......我也同你一样，在抚育着我所珍视的生命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "所以，目盲并不妨碍我感受你和你腹中的新生命......他给你带来了怎样的紧张与喜悦啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "我们萨卡兹从来不这么说话。所以你是萨科塔，是个有孩子的奇怪萨科塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "你就是在刚刚说的那个育什么堂，抚育你的孩子的？那到底是什么地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "“育婴圣堂”，你我此刻正站在它的荫蔽之中。新生命在那里诞下，得到抚育。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "一座“圣堂”......专门用来生孩子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "新生是神圣的。每一次新生，都是对拉特兰信仰的延续。唯有如此，我们才得以塑造未来的形貌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "听不懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "女士，你一直在荒野上流浪，孕期没有得到应有的照顾，你现在非常虚弱......他也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "你确定要在这时候离开近在咫尺的圣城，重回荒野？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "女士，你的名字叫“添头”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "不好听？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "我们知晓萨卡兹的困顿与艰难......许多萨卡兹母亲会随口给孩子起名“添头”，只把孩子视作自己生活中的一个小小的添头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "这名字跟我妈没关系，是我怀了这孩子之后，自己起的。谁能说清我和这孩子，到底谁是谁的添头？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "有什么问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "......你很看重自己与这个孩子的联系。你骄傲地希望让所有人都知道，你的生活里多出了这样一个小小的添头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "女士，这样伟大的情感，无关乎种族与仇恨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "我明白你在担心什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "此刻，这座修道院中的所有人——萨科塔、菲林、库兰塔、鲁珀、沃尔珀......所有人都是你我的见证。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "请放心，现在是万国峰会期间，无数异族的来客齐聚拉特兰，拉特兰还不至于在所有人都知情的情况下对一个怀孕的母亲做什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库兰塔",
      "text": "（点头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鲁珀",
      "text": "（传递眼神）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "我向你保证。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添头",
      "text": "那好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "感谢你的理解，女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "让我们共同迎接这个新生命在拉特兰降生，它将跨越隔阂，被赋予全新的意义，这次孕育将成为一次壮举。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "我为此而来......主遣我至应至之地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "text": "最后，欢迎来到拉特兰......如今的拉特兰需要各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "反正我帮不了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "哎呀，我还什么都没说呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "那请问，这位萨科塔小姐，你是要维修守护铳还是要定制弹药？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "出门往左，如果你的动作比那些公务员快，米迦莱昂区或许还剩下三四家铳械工坊没有被关停。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "十分钟前，我已经在第七厅的接收文书上签了字，现在经手任何相关的事情都等于触犯律法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "如果我说我想搞一场轰动全城的大爆炸呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "没兴趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "拜托，你可是“铳械工坊之王”潘大师！谁都能对爆炸不感兴趣，但那也不能是你啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "......不要拿你刚编的称号来恭维我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "潘大师，我知道你的难处啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "我也只是想请你帮点小忙而已——比如说借借你这里的设备，或者你的专业知识——帮我理解一下拉特兰现在的情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "毕竟我真的很着急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "我的老板说，无论发生什么都不能阻碍企鹅物流完成任务然后办派对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "不需要您亲手做任何事情，这样就不算触犯律法了，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "把你的守护铳从我的收藏上移开，萨科塔小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "尤其是，这把铳还*拉特兰俚语*是我亲手做的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "哈哈，你认出来了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "那你一定知道它的威力有多大吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "老师，我找保拉医生帮你重新配了一副眼镜！她数落了我好久，说你要是再接着戴之前那副古董眼镜，那简直就是自虐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "快换上试试看吧。呃——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "老师，这是怎么回事？！这个人是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "呀——这不是当初那个不太会说话的小姑娘嘛！什么时候说话这么利索啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "你叫什么来着，梵莉姆，梵妮斯，还是梵——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使&梵里妮",
      "text": "——梵里妮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "你看，我们的默契还在的嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "啊......我想起来了，小乐姐！你当时来工坊选自己的第一把守护铳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "每次店里来客，老师都不让我出去打扰客人......可是那天外面动静真的很大，我实在忍不住好奇......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "结果还是被老师发现了。我一直在害怕挨骂，其他的事情都记不太清了......对不起，小乐姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "是这样吗？你当时在害怕吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "（点头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "奇怪，我以为你当时很开心的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "对了，小乐姐，你今天来工坊，是为了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "（眨眼睛）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "梵妮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "text": "刚刚第七厅的人来过了，这间工坊已经......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "我还没有成为正式的制铳师，不算这间工坊的员工，应该不算触犯律法吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "text": "老师，让我来接待这位客人可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔强的小孩",
      "text": "保育员先生，抓到你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "骄傲的小孩",
      "text": "你跑到哪里去了呀，洛米雅说你在躲着我们，是真的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "怎么会呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔强的小孩",
      "text": "那我们一起去玩“光环游戏”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "今天由我来陪你们玩吧，安多恩叔叔还有事要做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "薇尔丽芙阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "我只是有些私事需要处理，很快就会回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "别紧张，你的暂离申请已经同步给我了。倒是你自己，明明请了假，却还在这里陪孩子们玩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......只是一场“光环游戏”的话，应该不会耽误。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "然后呢？你觉得孩子们会乖乖放你走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......我会想办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "我听到的说法是，你从来没办法拒绝孩子们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "因勤恳与虔诚而被牧首看重，并由她亲手培养起来的第一位保育员......曾经居然是违背律法的罪犯。谁能想到呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "薇尔丽芙阁下，我确实只是去参加一个朋友的家庭聚会，我们许久未见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "都说了不用紧张，我并不担心你在吹气球或者烤蛋糕的时候会把拉特兰炸掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "我只是好奇，为什么牧首眼中的你，与教皇厅记录中的你，像是两个截然不同的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......牧首从未忽视或否认我的罪行，薇尔丽芙阁下。她只是更看重我对她的理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "那时她还不是牧首，我只是在一座废弃的移动修道院躲避天灾时，恰巧与她相遇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "牧首眼盲，听觉却非常敏锐。在源石浪潮冲击远方山脉的轰响之中，她听到了从地下室传来的一声哀哭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "一位母亲，满身血污地蜷缩在阴影中，奄奄一息。她试图威吓牧首，保护自己的孩子，却只能做出痛苦的表情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "你和牧首最初带来圣城的那位母亲？她的伤是最有医德的医生也会放弃抢救的程度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "你们是如何判断出她能活下来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "我没有......我起初甚至不相信她能活过那个晚上。但牧首相信奇迹，仿佛那是天经地义之事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "牧首想要让我也相信，相信那位可怜的母亲能因我们而得救。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "她得救了，薇尔丽芙阁下......一开始，我对医疗护理的工作并不擅长，只好尽我所能地感受她、陪伴她、照顾她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "你们在一座搁浅荒野的修道院里滞留了三个月，就为了一个“奇迹”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......因为拉特兰需要一个奇迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "那你们还真是比我印象中要理性得多，或许我该对你们都刮目相看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "......如果这样有助于教皇厅支持育婴圣堂的工作的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "理性到有点无聊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇尔丽芙",
      "text": "快去快回吧，安多恩保育员，至少我还希望看到降生仪式顺利举行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
